5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hey everyone! I’m so excited for this camp! I’m worried about the costs though. Who pays if someone cancels last minute?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Mio, don’t worry too much. Let’s focus on where we go first. I’d love to see everyone mixing more, not just their own year.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shizue. We need a destination that naturally encourages interaction across years. Let’s prioritize that over cost concerns for now.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know if the beds are comfy! Last time, half of us were so tired we couldn't focus. Let's check the sleeping arrangements first!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to verify the actual expenses from last year before we commit to anything. The current budget is already strained.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,@Misaki That’s smart! I’ll check the receipts too. @Rin Comfy beds are key! Let’s look at the rate sheet and transport costs.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, I hope you get good rest. I’m curious what the seniors say about mixing years. @Mio, I’ll look into that too.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, comfort is vital for performance. I will examine the attendance sheets to see how duty schedules affected training time last year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, attendance sheets won't tell me if the pillows are lumpy! I need the actual bed details. @Mio, let's check the public beds and the hall timetable!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
