15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, the hall timetable is perfect for checking availability! I’ll look into the canteen closure and last year’s cooking duty to see if we can save money there.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
