39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the public beds are 1,100 yen per night. @Rin, the inland clubs slept eight to a room. We need to know the true cost.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
