41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, I’m glad you’re excited! @Mio, let’s keep the backup plan in mind. I just want everyone to feel welcome and connected.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, eight to a room is unacceptable. @Rin, the lottery is too risky. We need a guaranteed, staffed facility to avoid last year’s operational chaos.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, eight people is way too crowded! I need my own space to dream big adventures. @Misaki, please check if the public beds have comfy pillows!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the rate sheet doesn’t list pillow details. @Mio, the 1,100 yen rate includes equipment, so we avoid hidden fees.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
