47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, the 1,100 yen rate is reasonable. However, we must ensure the facility has staff to handle meals, eliminating the two-hour daily duty burden that ruined last year’s training.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, staff meals are perfect! I want to know if the public beds are actually soft. @Misaki, can you check the pillow firmness?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
